    {
      "subId": "2070402",
      "subQuestName": "帮萍姥姥在播种璃月百合花$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207040201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207040201": {
            "id": "207040201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 好的姥姥$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040202"
            ]
          },
          "207040202": {
            "id": "207040202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 咦？这不是琉璃百合的种子嘛？这不是璃月这边很稀有、很贵重的花$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040203"
            ]
          },
          "207040203": {
            "id": "207040203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 姥姥，这还不得挑一个良辰吉日来种么？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040204"
            ]
          },
          "207040204": {
            "id": "207040204",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 这哪是什么名贵的话，最开始，荻花州里可全都是琉璃百合，有很多年轻人会去那里唱歌跳舞$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040205"
            ]
          },
          "207040205": {
            "id": "207040205",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 只不过在一场战争之后，荻花州被洪水淹没，琉璃百合几乎都被毁了$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040206"
            ]
          },
          "207040206": {
            "id": "207040206",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 现在，失去了荻花州的琉璃百合，也只能在玉京台里种了。$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070403",
      "subQuestName": "回去向萍姥姥报告$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207040701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207040701": {
            "id": "207040701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 姥姥，我把种子都种好啦，但他们好像还没发芽$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040702"
            ]
          },
          "207040702": {
            "id": "207040702",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 孩子，为了让他发芽，你还得帮我做件事$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040703"
            ]
          },
          "207040703": {
            "id": "207040703",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 时过境迁，现在的天气里琉璃百合不是那么容易活下来，所以需要一点水史莱姆的凝液，才能让他们焕发生机$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040704"
            ]
          },
          "207040704": {
            "id": "207040704",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 在山的另一头的池塘旁，有一个史莱姆巢穴，去那里找一点史莱姆凝液，给种子浇上吧$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040705"
            ]
          },
          "207040705": {
            "id": "207040705",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 这个我可太拿手了，交给我吧姥姥$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070404",
      "subQuestName": "击败史莱姆，取得5个水史莱姆的精华液$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207040401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207040401": {
            "id": "207040401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test) 姥姥现在种璃月百合是为什么什么嘛？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040402"
            ]
          },
          "207040402": {
            "id": "207040402",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 也许有一天，我的那些离开璃月港很久的老朋友会从远方回来$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207040403"
            ]
          },
          "207040403": {
            "id": "207040403",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "萍姥姥",
            "text": "(test) 那时候，他们也会想看看他们熟悉的花吧$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
